WEBVTT

00:00:01.650 --> 00:00:02.440
The land of the samurai.

00:00:02.770 --> 00:00:06.080
There was a time, long ago, when our country was called by that name.

00:00:06.380 --> 00:00:11.260
With the arrival of the Amanto from outer space and the Sword Ban twenty years ago,

00:00:11.610 --> 00:00:13.710
the samurai class fell into decline.

00:00:14.610 --> 00:00:20.300
In these hard times, there was one man left with the spirit of the samurai. His name is Gintoki Sakata.

00:00:20.960 --> 00:00:25.380
Kagura and I, Shinpachi Shimura, work at Odd Jobs Gin, which is coincidentally...

00:00:25.380 --> 00:00:26.520
Enough already!

00:00:26.570 --> 00:00:31.180
Why would you reuse the introduction now?!

00:00:31.180 --> 00:00:33.180
Because this is supposed to be a new show!

00:00:33.180 --> 00:00:36.790
We have to explain the context for the newcomers!

00:00:36.790 --> 00:00:39.850
It's a waste of time to worry about the context of this anime.

00:00:40.180 --> 00:00:43.980
The audience is only kind of paying attention.

00:00:43.980 --> 00:00:44.750
Right.

00:00:45.280 --> 00:00:50.670
So Gintama is kind of back in 16:9.

00:02:38.700 --> 00:02:41.180
The first episode of Gintama in a year.

00:02:41.180 --> 00:02:43.480
It'll take a little time to get back in the flow,

00:02:43.480 --> 00:02:45.330
but for now, it's back to work.

00:02:46.050 --> 00:02:51.470
[Odd Jobs Gin-chan]
[Snack Otose]

00:02:46.170 --> 00:02:48.470
It feels like I haven't been here in forever.

00:02:49.650 --> 00:02:50.760
Good morning!

00:02:52.980 --> 00:02:54.350
I guess he's still asleep.

00:02:54.780 --> 00:02:56.900
Seriously, we're finally back on air...

00:02:57.420 --> 00:02:58.990
Wake up, Gin-san!

00:02:58.990 --> 00:03:00.310
Vacation's over.

00:03:00.600 --> 00:03:01.610
The show is back...

00:03:05.200 --> 00:03:07.770
This town hasn't changed...

00:03:08.640 --> 00:03:12.230
Everybody's walking around with glum faces.

00:03:12.230 --> 00:03:13.000
Wait!

00:03:13.000 --> 00:03:14.070
Who are you?!

00:03:14.070 --> 00:03:15.590
What are you doing in here?!

00:03:15.590 --> 00:03:16.230
I'll call the police...

00:03:16.230 --> 00:03:17.270
Shinpachi.

00:03:17.270 --> 00:03:19.240
You haven't changed either.

00:03:19.240 --> 00:03:23.600
Couldn't find anything to do while we ran reruns for a year?

00:03:23.600 --> 00:03:25.110
You never learn.

00:03:25.420 --> 00:03:27.080
Th-That voice...

00:03:27.450 --> 00:03:28.350
Hey, now.

00:03:28.900 --> 00:03:32.120
You even forgot my face?

00:03:32.820 --> 00:03:37.180
Well, they say it only takes a man three days to grow out of his boots.

00:03:37.850 --> 00:03:39.060
It's me.

00:03:40.750 --> 00:03:41.960
Gin-san.

00:03:42.270 --> 00:03:47.820
[Everyone Looks a Little Grown Up After Spring Break]

00:03:48.280 --> 00:03:49.720
What?!

00:03:49.720 --> 00:03:51.170
Long time no see, Pachi-boy.

00:03:51.460 --> 00:03:52.440
How you been doing?

00:03:52.440 --> 00:03:53.350
No, wait!

00:03:53.350 --> 00:03:54.490
Long time no see?!

00:03:54.490 --> 00:03:55.100
What?!

00:03:55.100 --> 00:03:57.110
Sure, it's been a year since the show was last on air...

00:03:57.110 --> 00:03:59.670
What the hell happened to you in the past year?!

00:03:59.670 --> 00:04:02.270
That's long enough for my hair to grow out.

00:04:02.270 --> 00:04:05.340
Forget your hair!  You look like a completely different character!

00:04:05.340 --> 00:04:09.370
You're acting like we just ran into each other for the first time in years at the World Martial Arts Tournament!

00:04:09.370 --> 00:04:10.740
Why do you have a scar?!

00:04:10.740 --> 00:04:12.690
Why do you have that patch on your chest?!

00:04:12.690 --> 00:04:14.110
What do you mean?

00:04:14.110 --> 00:04:16.000
Did you forget the promise we made?

00:04:16.000 --> 00:04:16.640
Huh?

00:04:16.640 --> 00:04:19.470
After the show ended, we held a little pow wow.

00:04:19.470 --> 00:04:20.330
Don't you remember?

00:04:20.330 --> 00:04:21.160
Huh?

00:04:21.160 --> 00:04:22.680
What are you talking about?

00:04:22.680 --> 00:04:24.430
With the TV show and movie over with,

00:04:24.430 --> 00:04:27.440
Gintama was starting to lose its novelty.

00:04:27.440 --> 00:04:29.310
So we discussed how it was necessary to

00:04:29.310 --> 00:04:33.130
give the show a breath of fresh air to keep the fans interested.

00:04:33.130 --> 00:04:38.050
Each of us would use this break to work on a remedy.

00:04:38.050 --> 00:04:41.730
And then we would return to New Odd Jobs.

00:04:42.620 --> 00:04:45.580
We'll meet up at Jabaody Archipelago in two years!

00:04:45.890 --> 00:04:47.640
We never made any promises!

00:04:47.850 --> 00:04:49.440
Where the hell is Jabaody Archipelago?!

00:04:49.440 --> 00:04:51.320
Doesn't matter where it is.

00:04:51.640 --> 00:04:53.390
It comes down to feeling and inspiration.

00:04:53.390 --> 00:04:54.760
Inspiration, my ass!

00:04:54.760 --> 00:04:56.290
You stole that promise from a different anime!

00:04:56.290 --> 00:04:58.210
Nobody was waiting for you fools!

00:04:58.210 --> 00:05:01.150
Man, I spent all my time training hard.

00:05:01.150 --> 00:05:02.640
What were you doing?

00:05:02.850 --> 00:05:04.410
I had a rough time.

00:05:04.830 --> 00:05:06.920
Getting blown up by weird aliens...

00:05:07.280 --> 00:05:09.100
Impaled by cyborgs...

00:05:09.510 --> 00:05:11.890
Losing my woman to some guy with a mad widow's peak...

00:05:11.890 --> 00:05:14.740
You keep using flashbacks from other shows!

00:05:14.740 --> 00:05:16.510
And you did all of this in one year?!

00:05:16.880 --> 00:05:18.190
Huh? One year?

00:05:18.430 --> 00:05:19.570
What are you talking about?

00:05:19.930 --> 00:05:23.670
Two years have passed in this anime in the past year.

00:05:23.900 --> 00:05:26.330
That's not much of a difference.

00:05:26.330 --> 00:05:27.560
And you're clearly lying!

00:05:27.560 --> 00:05:29.710
I mean, this show follows the Sazae format where nobody ages...

00:05:29.710 --> 00:05:30.860
I'm not lying.

00:05:30.860 --> 00:05:32.860
Just look at how much I've changed.

00:05:32.860 --> 00:05:34.050
I'm back!

00:05:34.530 --> 00:05:35.250
'Sup!

00:05:35.250 --> 00:05:36.970
Long time no see, guys!

00:05:36.970 --> 00:05:38.210
How you been doing?

00:05:38.710 --> 00:05:39.250
Huh?

00:05:39.250 --> 00:05:41.590
Did you shrink, Shinpachi?

00:05:41.790 --> 00:05:42.800
Uh, er...

00:05:42.800 --> 00:05:43.350
Excuse me.

00:05:43.720 --> 00:05:44.640
Who are you?

00:05:45.070 --> 00:05:46.740
What? It's me.

00:05:49.800 --> 00:05:50.800
Kagura.

00:05:50.870 --> 00:05:53.370
Wait!

00:05:53.370 --> 00:05:55.390
What?!

00:05:55.790 --> 00:05:58.060
You look exactly the same.

00:05:58.060 --> 00:05:59.060
Right?

00:05:59.060 --> 00:06:01.260
This guy didn't do anything the past two years.

00:06:01.260 --> 00:06:02.430
Wait! This is...

00:06:02.430 --> 00:06:03.440
Kagura-cha-

00:06:03.440 --> 00:06:04.650
Kagura-san?!

00:06:04.650 --> 00:06:05.990
You've gotta be kidding!

00:06:05.990 --> 00:06:08.310
She's completely grown up!

00:06:08.310 --> 00:06:11.530
They say it only takes a woman three days to grow out of her boots.

00:06:11.530 --> 00:06:12.650
No, they don't!

00:06:12.650 --> 00:06:14.260
I'm tired after the long trip.

00:06:14.260 --> 00:06:15.300
Bring me some clothes.

00:06:15.300 --> 00:06:16.280
I'm gonna take a nap.

00:06:16.280 --> 00:06:17.440
No, wait.

00:06:17.440 --> 00:06:19.420
There's something else we need to address first...

00:06:20.310 --> 00:06:21.380
Too slow, Nappa!

00:06:21.710 --> 00:06:22.510
She's fast...

00:06:22.770 --> 00:06:25.500
She changed into her pajamas and plopped herself on the couch the moment she got home.

00:06:25.500 --> 00:06:27.830
She's grown into one hell of a pajama girl.

00:06:27.830 --> 00:06:28.980
Am I supposed to be impressed?!

00:06:28.980 --> 00:06:31.210
And what was the point in standing on my head?!

00:06:31.210 --> 00:06:33.770
Kagura, where were you training?

00:06:33.770 --> 00:06:34.470
Nowhere really.

00:06:34.470 --> 00:06:36.710
I flew around space with Pappy.

00:06:36.710 --> 00:06:38.720
Oh, I brought some souvenirs you can eat...

00:06:40.100 --> 00:06:40.700
Huh?

00:06:40.700 --> 00:06:42.360
Are you talking about this?

00:06:42.360 --> 00:06:43.780
Sorry, I already ate it.

00:06:43.780 --> 00:06:44.980
He's fast...

00:06:44.980 --> 00:06:47.240
He finished them off before I even mentioned them...

00:06:47.240 --> 00:06:49.790
Gin-chan's grown into one hell of a greedy guy.

00:06:49.790 --> 00:06:50.970
That wouldn't be considered growth!

00:06:50.970 --> 00:06:55.010
And do you feel you have to stand on my head to look impressive?!

00:06:55.980 --> 00:06:59.520
It appears that my two years of training wasn't for nothing.

00:06:59.520 --> 00:07:02.410
We're going to start a new legend here at New Odd Jobs!

00:07:02.410 --> 00:07:03.550
I'm getting excited!

00:07:03.550 --> 00:07:04.890
Nothing's changed!

00:07:04.890 --> 00:07:06.780
Hell, the two of you have regressed!

00:07:07.180 --> 00:07:09.000
Anyway, is it true?!

00:07:09.000 --> 00:07:12.310
Two years have passed while I wasn't paying attention?!

00:07:12.310 --> 00:07:13.920
Nobody told me about this!

00:07:14.190 --> 00:07:16.350
Why was I the only one left behind?!

00:07:16.900 --> 00:07:19.890
That's what happens when you treat the break as a vacation.

00:07:20.070 --> 00:07:23.030
You're supposed to work hard when people aren't watching.

00:07:23.030 --> 00:07:27.590
You're the one who's trying to convince everyone you were training during the break!

00:07:27.490 --> 00:07:40.510
[Sugar Content]

00:07:27.960 --> 00:07:32.820
Personally, I want to know how you're able to look exactly the same after two years.

00:07:33.110 --> 00:07:35.270
Two years is enough for ramen to grow stale.

00:07:35.270 --> 00:07:39.030
By the way, Sadaharu tagged along with me and grew a lot, Nappa.

00:07:39.030 --> 00:07:40.510
Can you stop calling me Nappa?

00:07:42.250 --> 00:07:43.910
Ah, it must be Sadaharu!

00:07:44.150 --> 00:07:48.220
Pets weren't allowed on my ship, so I had to put him on a different one.

00:07:50.980 --> 00:07:53.500
Oh, he hasn't changed at all.

00:07:53.930 --> 00:07:56.280
Why did you say that he grew a lot, Kagura-san?

00:07:56.610 --> 00:07:58.820
Actually, he looks smaller now?

00:07:59.010 --> 00:08:00.230
Here's the receipt.

00:08:01.200 --> 00:08:06.450
[Odd Jobs Gin-chan]

00:08:09.080 --> 00:08:10.380
Uh...

00:08:10.380 --> 00:08:11.650
Excuse me.

00:08:11.650 --> 00:08:13.060
Sadaharu just left.

00:08:14.390 --> 00:08:17.970
Uh, our pet just ran off, Mister.

00:08:18.510 --> 00:08:19.750
It's been a while.

00:08:21.620 --> 00:08:24.620
I, Sadaharu, have finished serving my time.

00:08:24.620 --> 00:08:25.970
Him?!

00:08:26.150 --> 00:08:27.290
Hold on!

00:08:27.290 --> 00:08:28.650
That's impossible!

00:08:28.650 --> 00:08:31.240
This is clearly the delivery man!

00:08:31.240 --> 00:08:33.650
That dog was obviously Sadaharu!

00:08:33.650 --> 00:08:36.350
That was a delivery dog from Planet Komainu.

00:08:36.530 --> 00:08:40.250
Sadaharu's shy, so I had him delivered by a dog just like him.

00:08:40.250 --> 00:08:41.190
Just like him?!

00:08:41.190 --> 00:08:42.640
That was obviously Sadaharu!

00:08:42.640 --> 00:08:45.230
And they don't look anything like each other!

00:08:45.870 --> 00:08:48.410
Like I said, he grew a lot.

00:08:48.410 --> 00:08:50.290
This isn't called growing a lot!

00:08:50.290 --> 00:08:52.330
This is called turning into a completely different creature!

00:08:52.390 --> 00:08:56.630
Shinpachi, dogs grow faster than humans.

00:08:56.630 --> 00:08:59.010
Two years is enough for them to become old men.

00:08:59.010 --> 00:09:00.860
This guy is literally just an old man!

00:09:01.630 --> 00:09:02.930
Brother Shinpachi,

00:09:02.930 --> 00:09:06.560
if I've done anything to offend you, I apologize.

00:09:06.560 --> 00:09:07.470
Brother?!

00:09:07.470 --> 00:09:10.550
Please don't blame Sister.

00:09:10.550 --> 00:09:12.640
I will make amends!

00:09:14.020 --> 00:09:17.100
If a doggy or two will satisfy you...

00:09:17.100 --> 00:09:18.020
Wait!

00:09:18.020 --> 00:09:19.390
Wait, wait, wait!

00:09:19.540 --> 00:09:20.800
What do you mean by doggy?!

00:09:20.800 --> 00:09:22.400
Why does this remind me of pinky amputation?!

00:09:22.400 --> 00:09:23.580
What's wrong with this Sadaharu?!

00:09:23.580 --> 00:09:25.420
Why is he acting like a direct-to-video fan?!

00:09:25.500 --> 00:09:26.230
Huh?

00:09:26.230 --> 00:09:26.960
Wait a second.

00:09:26.960 --> 00:09:27.880
That's...

00:09:27.880 --> 00:09:29.710
On closer look, there's something at the end of his tail...

00:09:29.710 --> 00:09:30.770
Sadaharu?!

00:09:30.790 --> 00:09:32.190
There's a small Sadaharu on his tail?!

00:09:32.730 --> 00:09:33.510
What's this?

00:09:33.860 --> 00:09:35.330
What's going on?!

00:09:36.670 --> 00:09:38.240
Uncle, Brother...

00:09:38.950 --> 00:09:41.650
Mind if I tell you an old story?

00:09:42.680 --> 00:09:47.050
There was a very happy dog who belonged to very wonderful owners.

00:09:47.420 --> 00:09:54.550
However, the dog always wondered if he was worthy of his owners.

00:09:55.030 --> 00:09:59.000
In order to join his owners as they marched on, to move forward,

00:09:59.000 --> 00:10:02.430
the dog chose to fight alongside them.

00:10:02.810 --> 00:10:06.170
Day after day, he would place his tail in scorching sand.

00:10:06.170 --> 00:10:07.520
Why would you do that?

00:10:07.810 --> 00:10:11.730
Day after day, he would make his tail watch Karate Kid 3.

00:10:11.730 --> 00:10:12.850
Why would you do that?

00:10:13.310 --> 00:10:18.130
Eventually, a firm wart appeared on his tail.

00:10:18.430 --> 00:10:20.660
It continued to grow bigger.

00:10:21.120 --> 00:10:23.220
However, as the wart grew in size,

00:10:23.220 --> 00:10:24.870
his body shrunk.

00:10:25.130 --> 00:10:27.670
As though the wart was sapping his strength...

00:10:27.670 --> 00:10:28.920
Do you understand?

00:10:28.920 --> 00:10:32.000
That's right - I am that wart.

00:10:32.000 --> 00:10:33.330
How could I possibly understand?!

00:10:33.330 --> 00:10:36.600
Long story short, the wart traded places with the original.

00:10:36.600 --> 00:10:38.600
That's so short that I have no idea what you mean!

00:10:39.190 --> 00:10:40.200
Do not worry.

00:10:40.490 --> 00:10:42.460
Sadaharu and I may be different in appearance,

00:10:42.460 --> 00:10:45.820
but our minds are connected through this tail, and we share the same destiny.

00:10:46.210 --> 00:10:47.090
You can call us the Wartio Brothers.

00:10:47.090 --> 00:10:48.480
That's not funny!

00:10:48.720 --> 00:10:50.130
Please call me Wartiharu.

00:10:50.330 --> 00:10:51.630
It is an honor.

00:10:51.630 --> 00:10:52.610
I'm not gonna call you that!

00:10:52.610 --> 00:10:55.230
How are we supposed to keep this freak as a pet?!

00:10:55.230 --> 00:10:56.070
I won't have it!

00:10:56.070 --> 00:10:57.850
I refuse to accept this!

00:10:58.650 --> 00:10:59.930
Hey! Wait, Nappa!

00:11:00.180 --> 00:11:02.220
Otose-san!

00:11:02.650 --> 00:11:03.440
Hello?

00:11:03.440 --> 00:11:04.540
Listen to this!

00:11:04.540 --> 00:11:05.510
Gin-san and Kagura are...

00:11:05.510 --> 00:11:07.480
What's all the fuss about?

00:11:07.480 --> 00:11:08.950
Don't just barge into a lady's room.

00:11:08.950 --> 00:11:10.800
You should knock first.

00:11:11.150 --> 00:11:13.680
Is there a fight going on, Master Shinpachi?

00:11:14.020 --> 00:11:17.120
It's probably something stupid again.

00:11:17.320 --> 00:11:18.440
Just ignore him.

00:11:18.440 --> 00:11:20.200
It's a waste of time to listen to him.

00:11:20.550 --> 00:11:21.720
I knew it...

00:11:21.720 --> 00:11:23.740
You haven't changed at all...

00:11:23.990 --> 00:11:25.950
They were lying about two years passing.

00:11:25.950 --> 00:11:28.520
What are you babbling about?

00:11:28.900 --> 00:11:31.510
In any case, it's been...

00:11:31.850 --> 00:11:33.330
...quite some time since I've seen you.

00:11:33.330 --> 00:11:34.620
A long time.

00:11:34.620 --> 00:11:36.580
A very long time.

00:11:38.400 --> 00:11:40.150
You're all Wartiharu!

00:11:40.150 --> 00:11:42.220
Oh, you recognize us?

00:11:42.220 --> 00:11:43.070
There's nothing to recognize!

00:11:43.070 --> 00:11:44.930
You've all evolved into different creatures!

00:11:44.930 --> 00:11:46.990
And an android is capable of growing warts?!

00:11:46.990 --> 00:11:49.600
They were all intent on improving themselves,

00:11:49.600 --> 00:11:52.740
and after pushing themselves too hard for two years, we were born.

00:11:53.000 --> 00:11:56.330
For now, you can call us Wartise, Wartirine, and Warti.

00:11:56.450 --> 00:11:58.800
So there's nothing left of Tama-san?!

00:11:59.380 --> 00:12:00.560
Like I said,

00:12:01.100 --> 00:12:04.510
everybody's been working hard while you weren't watching.

00:12:04.870 --> 00:12:06.310
We've all been trying to grow.

00:12:06.310 --> 00:12:08.820
Only their warts have grown!

00:12:08.820 --> 00:12:11.540
Pachi-boy, it doesn't matter what you think.

00:12:11.760 --> 00:12:13.090
The past two years aren't coming back.

00:12:13.430 --> 00:12:15.580
You have to face reality and look to the future.

00:12:16.770 --> 00:12:19.440
You'll have plenty of chances to redeem yourself!

00:12:20.140 --> 00:12:21.730
Right now, you're denying yourself that chance...

00:12:22.290 --> 00:12:24.530
The chance to create a wart!

00:12:24.530 --> 00:12:26.360
You bet I'm gonna deny that chance!

00:12:27.200 --> 00:12:28.830
Just leave me alone.

00:12:29.310 --> 00:12:32.430
There was a two year jump during the one year break like in One Piece...

00:12:33.500 --> 00:12:35.490
Warts turning into old men...

00:12:37.040 --> 00:12:39.500
Everybody leaving me behind...

00:12:39.920 --> 00:12:42.270
How am I supposed to accept this?!

00:12:54.580 --> 00:12:56.240
Shin-chan, may I come in?

00:12:56.840 --> 00:12:58.090
Sorry.

00:12:58.220 --> 00:13:00.570
I don't want to see anyone right now.

00:13:01.620 --> 00:13:05.680
It feels like everyone's gone to a faraway place.

00:13:07.990 --> 00:13:10.940
I've experienced this many times before.

00:13:11.780 --> 00:13:14.980
I dream about this all the time, Sis.

00:13:16.070 --> 00:13:18.760
We're all running in the darkness.

00:13:19.530 --> 00:13:22.040
But everyone else is faster than me.

00:13:22.650 --> 00:13:24.090
I try my best to catch up,

00:13:24.640 --> 00:13:28.580
but I end up alone in the darkness.

00:13:30.760 --> 00:13:32.990
Shin-chan, you're a lucky boy.

00:13:34.130 --> 00:13:38.290
Because you have a goal to guide you through the darkness.

00:13:39.050 --> 00:13:43.730
The truly unfortunate are those who stand still without any sense of which direction to go.

00:13:44.130 --> 00:13:50.970
And it's hardest on the person who's running out in front when he can't tell left from right...

00:13:52.630 --> 00:13:56.650
True, they aren't nice enough to slow down for you.

00:13:57.260 --> 00:13:59.820
They may take a lot of detours...

00:14:00.320 --> 00:14:04.790
But you believe that he's moving forward, right?

00:14:05.250 --> 00:14:08.190
You're very fortunate to have someone like that, Shin-chan.

00:14:09.110 --> 00:14:11.840
No matter how far away he gets, you'll still be able to see him.

00:14:12.190 --> 00:14:15.710
And as long as you keep moving, I know that you'll be able to catch up.

00:14:16.160 --> 00:14:17.160
It only makes sense.

00:14:17.680 --> 00:14:22.750
Since I'll be there to kick you along.

00:14:24.270 --> 00:14:25.110
Sis...

00:14:25.890 --> 00:14:27.140
Sis...

00:14:27.730 --> 00:14:29.630
Sis!

00:14:29.630 --> 00:14:31.990
It doesn't matter if two years have passed!

00:14:31.990 --> 00:14:36.000
I can go anywhere if I'm with you!

00:14:38.070 --> 00:14:40.450
That's the little brother I know!

00:14:40.450 --> 00:14:42.690
You can hang on tight to the two of us!

00:14:42.690 --> 00:14:43.670
I won't go easy on you!

00:14:43.670 --> 00:14:46.390
But I promise to take you to Neverland!

00:14:46.620 --> 00:14:47.150
Honestly...

00:14:47.150 --> 00:14:50.970
Don't get so excited that you forget about us, Isao-san.

00:14:51.280 --> 00:14:52.930
Though I'll always be right behind you.

00:14:53.230 --> 00:14:55.330
Now that we're all happy, let's have dinner!

00:14:55.610 --> 00:14:58.290
Hurry up, or you won't get any!

00:14:58.290 --> 00:15:00.320
Please, wait for me, Isao-san!

00:15:00.320 --> 00:15:02.760
What's for dinner tonight?

00:15:03.530 --> 00:15:04.980
Your favorite.

00:15:05.130 --> 00:15:06.190
What? Curry...

00:15:06.190 --> 00:15:07.090
Omelets.

00:15:07.090 --> 00:15:08.050
Thought so!

00:15:08.180 --> 00:15:09.660
Y-Yay!

00:15:09.940 --> 00:15:12.760
This will help me forget everything bad that's happened!

00:15:26.260 --> 00:15:27.660
Now, Isao-san.

00:15:27.660 --> 00:15:28.950
Open wide!

00:15:28.950 --> 00:15:31.010
Come on, Otae-san.

00:15:31.010 --> 00:15:33.400
I can eat my own food.

00:15:33.400 --> 00:15:36.300
Please, why are you acting so shy?

00:15:36.750 --> 00:15:38.250
We're married now.

00:15:38.250 --> 00:15:39.580
This is a perfectly normal thing to do.

00:15:39.580 --> 00:15:41.840
You're such a doll!

00:15:41.840 --> 00:15:44.860
Nobody would be able to guess which one of us used to stalk the other one!

00:15:45.160 --> 00:15:46.920
Don't say that.

00:15:46.920 --> 00:15:49.790
If I'd known how kind you were,

00:15:49.790 --> 00:15:52.120
I could have found happiness much sooner.

00:15:52.980 --> 00:15:56.290
I never imagined that you would quit the Shinsengumi and help us with our dojo.

00:15:56.590 --> 00:15:59.750
The Shinsengumi can do fine without me.

00:16:00.120 --> 00:16:01.940
They have plenty of responsible people.

00:16:02.610 --> 00:16:06.330
But it's my job to support you, Otae-san.

00:16:06.700 --> 00:16:09.220
I'm hopeless without you...

00:16:09.450 --> 00:16:11.060
Oh, please!

00:16:11.530 --> 00:16:13.250
I can't believe I said that!

00:16:13.250 --> 00:16:14.570
I'm finished eating...

00:16:14.570 --> 00:16:15.680
Oh, Shin-chan?

00:16:15.680 --> 00:16:16.870
You barely touched your food.

00:16:16.870 --> 00:16:19.280
You need to eat so you can work, Shinpachi-kun.

00:16:19.390 --> 00:16:20.200
Huh?

00:16:20.200 --> 00:16:22.950
Today's your first day on the job!

00:16:23.340 --> 00:16:24.100
That's right.

00:16:24.610 --> 00:16:27.620
Isao-san helped you find this wonderful job,

00:16:27.620 --> 00:16:28.820
so you need to work hard.

00:16:29.380 --> 00:16:29.930
Here.

00:16:32.770 --> 00:16:35.810
It feels good to know that you'll be there to replace me.

00:16:35.810 --> 00:16:37.220
I'm trusting you to take care of the Shinsengumi.

00:16:37.900 --> 00:16:41.440
We won't see each other much since you'll be living there while training,

00:16:41.670 --> 00:16:42.650
but do your best.

00:16:42.680 --> 00:16:43.770
The two of us...

00:16:44.740 --> 00:16:48.110
No, the three of us will always be here to support you.

00:16:48.440 --> 00:16:49.160
Right.

00:16:49.630 --> 00:16:50.150
Hmm?

00:16:50.150 --> 00:16:51.030
Three of us?

00:16:51.520 --> 00:16:52.770
Three of us...?

00:16:53.900 --> 00:16:57.350
Shin-chan, you'll be an uncle when you return.

00:16:58.010 --> 00:17:01.650
Become a samurai that will make this child proud.

00:17:02.040 --> 00:17:05.100
R-Really, Otae-san?!

00:17:05.340 --> 00:17:06.840
I'm going to be a father?!

00:17:06.840 --> 00:17:08.030
Did you hear that, Shinpachi-kun?!

00:17:08.030 --> 00:17:08.890
H-Huh?

00:17:08.890 --> 00:17:10.100
Shinpachi-kun?!

00:17:11.210 --> 00:17:12.730
He's fired up!

00:17:13.280 --> 00:17:15.560
Man, he's a very dependable little brother...

00:17:15.780 --> 00:17:17.380
No, a very dependable uncle.

00:17:18.120 --> 00:17:19.620
That was when Ikazo...

00:17:33.950 --> 00:17:36.660
Are you shitting me?!

00:17:37.160 --> 00:17:38.090
God!

00:17:38.090 --> 00:17:39.970
What have I done to deserve this?!

00:17:39.970 --> 00:17:42.100
I go on vacation for a year and this is what happens?!

00:17:42.100 --> 00:17:43.300
It's not right!

00:17:43.300 --> 00:17:44.770
The Odd Jobs members have changed!

00:17:44.770 --> 00:17:47.140
And what's worse, that gorilla of a stalker somehow managed to land my sister

00:17:47.140 --> 00:17:50.190
and become my older brother!

00:17:50.190 --> 00:17:52.090
I'm the third wheel now!

00:17:52.090 --> 00:17:55.310
They sent me to the Shinsengumi to get me out of the house!

00:17:55.310 --> 00:17:57.610
I'm completely out of the loop at Odd Jobs, at my own home!

00:17:57.610 --> 00:18:03.010
This short amount of time was all it took to leave me with nowhere to belong?!

00:18:04.240 --> 00:18:05.370
This is awful...

00:18:05.370 --> 00:18:08.760
It's like I'm the only person left in an unknown world...

00:18:09.530 --> 00:18:12.560
Where am I supposed to go?

00:18:14.850 --> 00:18:17.090
I understand how you feel.

00:18:17.640 --> 00:18:19.140
I was once in your position.

00:18:20.910 --> 00:18:23.120
Ky-Kyubei-san?!

00:18:24.200 --> 00:18:26.780
Sh-She totally looks like a girl now!

00:18:27.800 --> 00:18:28.830
And her hand...

00:18:30.540 --> 00:18:31.540
S-Sorry...

00:18:33.850 --> 00:18:34.680
Kyubei-san...

00:18:35.670 --> 00:18:38.030
You're okay with touching men now?

00:18:38.590 --> 00:18:39.850
And your clothes...

00:18:40.160 --> 00:18:40.990
S-Sorry...

00:18:41.580 --> 00:18:44.240
I couldn't ignore you when I saw you crying...

00:18:45.620 --> 00:18:47.440
Otae-chan is gone now,

00:18:48.180 --> 00:18:49.910
so I decided that I needed to change.

00:18:50.490 --> 00:18:51.260
I see...

00:18:51.650 --> 00:18:53.440
Because she lost my sister...

00:18:54.100 --> 00:18:55.280
D-Do I look strange?

00:18:55.280 --> 00:18:57.300
Ah! Sorry about what I said!

00:18:57.300 --> 00:18:58.520
You look really cute!

00:18:58.520 --> 00:18:59.930
You're totally my type!

00:19:01.980 --> 00:19:03.490
Th-Thank you...

00:19:05.930 --> 00:19:08.400
U-Um, Shinpachi-kun,

00:19:08.390 --> 00:19:09.620
you aren't alone.

00:19:10.120 --> 00:19:11.040
I'm here for you.

00:19:11.460 --> 00:19:14.040
So you can come here when you're feeling down.

00:19:14.410 --> 00:19:15.700
I come here all the time.

00:19:16.060 --> 00:19:19.670
It helps when there's someone else who feels the same way as you do.

00:19:20.680 --> 00:19:23.110
And do you mind if I ask a favor in return?

00:19:23.510 --> 00:19:24.120
Huh?

00:19:24.550 --> 00:19:25.840
Well, um...

00:19:26.230 --> 00:19:29.300
Could you experiment by touching me from time to time?

00:19:29.300 --> 00:19:30.140
Huh?

00:19:30.140 --> 00:19:31.340
What's she talking about?

00:19:32.170 --> 00:19:34.380
It seems that I'm fine when you touch me.

00:19:35.200 --> 00:19:36.180
I wonder why?

00:19:36.180 --> 00:19:38.350
Maybe it's because you resemble Tae-chan.

00:19:38.680 --> 00:19:39.450
Or maybe...

00:19:40.570 --> 00:19:43.590
M-My heart is about to burst!

00:19:44.010 --> 00:19:46.460
I want to forget about Tae-chan...

00:19:46.710 --> 00:19:50.120
I have to learn to live with men.

00:19:51.920 --> 00:19:52.670
So...

00:19:53.260 --> 00:19:54.340
Is it okay?

00:19:54.340 --> 00:19:56.860
Was Kyubei-san always this cute?!

00:19:57.360 --> 00:19:58.100
It's okay!

00:19:58.100 --> 00:19:59.100
Absolutely okay!

00:19:59.100 --> 00:20:01.180
I can help you every day if you want!

00:20:01.180 --> 00:20:03.420
I'll help you with anything you need!

00:20:03.420 --> 00:20:04.470
I can touch you every day!

00:20:04.760 --> 00:20:05.660
R-Really?

00:20:06.170 --> 00:20:07.160
I'm so happy.

00:20:07.160 --> 00:20:08.710
Then touch me more.

00:20:11.910 --> 00:20:14.670
Please be gentle when you experiment.

00:20:15.110 --> 00:20:16.420
Wait! What?

00:20:16.420 --> 00:20:17.210
Hold on!

00:20:17.210 --> 00:20:18.010
Kyubei-san!

00:20:18.010 --> 00:20:18.560
If I...

00:20:18.560 --> 00:20:19.580
If I experiment there...

00:20:19.580 --> 00:20:20.330
I'll...

00:20:20.670 --> 00:20:21.930
I'll...

00:20:22.430 --> 00:20:25.670
...turn into a mad scientist!

00:20:33.870 --> 00:20:34.730
Huh?

00:20:35.120 --> 00:20:36.910
There's something here...

00:20:37.520 --> 00:20:38.940
Something that feels very familiar...

00:20:39.380 --> 00:20:40.260
Well?

00:20:40.390 --> 00:20:41.830
How is it compared to yours?

00:20:42.460 --> 00:20:43.990
I just finished having the procedure,

00:20:44.240 --> 00:20:47.160
but I couldn't tell, is there anything abnormal about it?

00:20:48.690 --> 00:20:49.740
What procedure?

00:20:50.160 --> 00:20:50.840
For that.

00:20:51.240 --> 00:20:52.130
For what?

00:20:52.980 --> 00:20:55.010
The procedure to attach a male organ.

00:20:57.160 --> 00:20:59.310
What the hell did you do?!

00:20:59.310 --> 00:21:02.550
You were asking me to touch your balls?!

00:21:02.550 --> 00:21:05.800
Unlike before, I'm a woman on the outside and a man on the inside.

00:21:05.800 --> 00:21:08.000
I've been completely reborn!

00:21:08.000 --> 00:21:10.530
You've only made it worse!

00:21:11.320 --> 00:21:14.440
I'm tired of trying to become a man or a woman.

00:21:14.780 --> 00:21:18.190
Now, I search for a new world where gender doesn't matter

00:21:18.420 --> 00:21:20.220
with those people.

00:21:20.220 --> 00:21:21.330
Kyu-chan!

00:21:21.330 --> 00:21:23.040
We're heading back!

00:21:23.040 --> 00:21:25.630
Oh, it's the cutie from Odd Jobs.

00:21:23.110 --> 00:21:25.640
She's aiming for a incredibly wrong new world?!

00:21:25.630 --> 00:21:28.920
Kyu-chan's trying to steal him! Eek!

00:21:25.640 --> 00:21:28.920
It's bon voyage to a new world with the blue beard pirates?!

00:21:29.120 --> 00:21:31.430
Wait, are you working at a gay bar?!

00:21:31.510 --> 00:21:34.340
Heh, I'm their ace.

00:21:34.340 --> 00:21:35.480
Why are you so proud?!

00:21:35.480 --> 00:21:38.310
This is so crazy that I have no idea what's going on anymore!

00:21:38.850 --> 00:21:40.870
Enough, Sir Kyubei.

00:21:41.230 --> 00:21:43.420
You actually attached that foul member to your body.

00:21:43.420 --> 00:21:46.110
I see that you're intent on making your character overlap with mine.

00:21:46.310 --> 00:21:47.370
You are...

00:21:47.370 --> 00:21:49.330
We are both considered serious characters.

00:21:49.330 --> 00:21:51.090
We only differ in gender.

00:21:51.530 --> 00:21:54.470
You intend to eliminate that difference and take over my role.

00:21:55.680 --> 00:21:57.230
But I was one step ahead of you!

00:21:57.230 --> 00:21:59.750
While you were attaching that foul member...

00:22:00.550 --> 00:22:01.530
I...

00:22:05.100 --> 00:22:08.670
Became Zurako!

00:22:09.960 --> 00:22:12.000
[To Be Continued]

00:23:39.430 --> 00:23:44.970
[Next Episode]

00:23:39.430 --> 00:23:44.970
[Everyone Looks Pretty Grown Up After Summer Break]

00:23:39.770 --> 00:23:40.970
The show is finally back,

00:23:40.970 --> 00:23:43.980
but what the hell is going on with everyone?!
